,"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Guilford County has come in under 90% of normal in October to November in 39 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 that pair ran 40% of normal on the middle, and November to December ran 33%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 35% of normal on the middle and April to May at 47%. Grid 19701 had its driest year in 2001 at 73% of normal.</p>"}
